OL,3,AMajor test for Australia's social media
OL,4,Aban begins in High Court
OL,5,
OL,6,FAustralia's rush to put in place a
OL,7,Flandmark social media ban for children
OL,8,Fled to "ill thought out" reforms which
OL,9,Fhave robbed them of their right to free
OL,10,Fcommunication, the country's top court
OL,11,Fhas been told.
OL,13,FIn a major test for the world-leading
OL,14,Fpolicy, online forum Reddit and a
OL,15,Fdigital rights group argued at a
OL,16,Fhearing on Tuesday that the law should
OL,17,Fbe struck down as it is
OL,18,Funconstitutional.
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
