OL,3,AMajor test for Australia's social media
OL,4,Aban begins in High Court
OL,5,
OL,6,FIntroduced last December, the ban is
OL,7,Famong a number of online safety reforms
OL,8,Fthe Australian government has
OL,9,Fspearheaded in recent years.
OL,11,FSupporters say it protects children
OL,12,Ffrom harmful content, but critics say
OL,13,Fit is too blunt an instrument and
OL,14,Fefforts should focus on improving
OL,15,Fonline safety.
